  "description": "Mesh UV unwrapper for the Prowl Game Engine. Produces lightmap-style atlases from arbitrary triangle meshes using Lloyd-style chart segmentation, angle-based flattening (LinABF), and least-squares conformal mapping (LSCM), then packs the charts into [0,1]². Parallel, SIMD-vectorised CG solver, ~30s on Sponza (260k tris) on a desktop CPU.",
